<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"><meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no, url=no"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark"><title>Kaeso 1.4.0 is out</title><!--[if mso]><noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:AllowPNG/><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript><style>table,td,div,p,a,h1,h2{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]--><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}table,td{border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt}img{border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic}a[x-apple-data-detectors],#MessageViewBody a{color:inherit!important;text-decoration:none!important;font:inherit!important}@media (max-width:480px){.k-gutter{padding:24px 16px 40px 16px!important}.k-h1{font-size:24px!important;line-height:32px!important}.k-stat-value{font-size:20px!important;line-height:28px!important}.k-dt{width:112px!important}}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.k-bg{background-color:#000000!important}.k-panel{background-color:#171717!important}.k-rule,.k-rule td{border-color:#262626!important}.k-text,.k-text a{color:#fafafa!important}.k-secondary{color:#a3a3a3!important}.k-tertiary,.k-tertiary a{color:#8f8f8f!important}.k-button{background-color:#fafafa!important;color:#000000!important}.k-logo-light{display:none!important}.k-logo-dark{display:block!important;max-height:none!important;overflow:visible!important}}[data-ogsc] .k-bg{background-color:#000000!important}[data-ogsc] .k-panel{background-color:#171717!important}[data-ogsc] .k-rule,[data-ogsc] .k-rule td{border-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsc] .k-text,[data-ogsc] .k-text a{color:#fafafa!important}[data-ogsc] .k-secondary{color:#a3a3a3!important}[data-ogsc] .k-tertiary,[data-ogsc] .k-tertiary a{color:#8f8f8f!important}[data-ogsc] .k-button{background-color:#fafafa!important;color:#000000!important}[data-ogsc] .k-logo-light{display:none!important}[data-ogsc] .k-logo-dark{display:block!important;max-height:none!important;overflow:visible!important}[data-ogsb] .k-bg{background-color:#000000!important}[data-ogsb] .k-panel{background-color:#171717!important}[data-ogsb] .k-rule,[data-ogsb] .k-rule td{border-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .k-text,[data-ogsb] .k-text a{color:#fafafa!important}[data-ogsb] .k-secondary{color:#a3a3a3!important}[data-ogsb] .k-tertiary,[data-ogsb] .k-tertiary a{color:#8f8f8f!important}[data-ogsb] .k-button{background-color:#fafafa!important;color:#000000!important}[data-ogsb] .k-logo-light{display:none!important}[data-ogsb] .k-logo-dark{display:block!important;max-height:none!important;overflow:visible!important}</style></head><body class="k-bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ffffff;"><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;max-height:0;max-width:0;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;" aria-hidden="true">It installs by itself in the next update window.&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;</div><div class="k-bg" role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Kaeso 1.4.0 is out" lang="en" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ffffff;"><table class="k-bg" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ffffff;"><tr><td class="k-gutter" align="left" style="padding:40px 32px 48px 32px;"><!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="left"><tr><td><![endif]--><div style="max-width:560px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 32px 0;"><img src="cid:cover-release@kaeso" width="560" height="240" alt="The Kaeso wordmark beside release art of orange, yellow and blue shapes" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;"></td></tr><tr><td><h1 class="k-text k-h1" style="margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:36px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:-0.56px;">Kaeso 1.4.0 is out</h1></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:12px 0 0 0;"><p class="k-secondary" style="margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c5c;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">It installs by itself in the next update window.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0 0;"><table class="k-rule" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="k-tertiary k-dt" width="168" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:8px 16px 8px 0;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Version</td><td class="k-text" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#0a0a0a;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:8px 0;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">1.4.0</td></tr><tr><td class="k-tertiary k-dt" width="168" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:8px 16px 8px 0;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Running now</td><td class="k-text" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#0a0a0a;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:8px 0;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">0.5.6</td></tr><tr><td class="k-tertiary k-dt" width="168" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:8px 16px 8px 0;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Installs</td><td class="k-text" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#0a0a0a;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:8px 0;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">By itself, 9 Nov 2026, 03:00 UTC</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;">​</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:32px 0 0 0;"><h2 class="k-text" style="margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0 0 8px 0;">What changed</h2><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="k-tertiary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px 0;">•</td><td class="k-secondary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c5c;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0 0 8px 0;">Cerebras is a built-in provider: add its key and call its models from any app format.</td></tr><tr><td class="k-tertiary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px 0;">•</td><td class="k-secondary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c5c;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0 0 8px 0;">The gateway serves more requests per second under heavy load and spends less CPU on each.</td></tr><tr><td class="k-tertiary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px 0;">•</td><td class="k-secondary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c5c;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0 0 8px 0;">Kaeso translates streamed replies with less work per chunk, 1.3 to 1.6 times faster for the common pairs.</td></tr><tr><td class="k-tertiary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px 0;">•</td><td class="k-secondary" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c5c;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0 0 8px 0;">Streamed tool calls keep the tool name the app defined.</td></tr></table><p class="k-tertiary" style="margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0 0 0 16px;">And 2 more changes in the release notes.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:32px 0 0 0;"><!--[if mso]><v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="https://kaeso.example.com/orgs/org_1" style="height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:156px;" arcsize="50%" stroke="f" fillcolor="#0a0a0a"><w:anchorlock/><center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;">Open updates</center></v:roundrect><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><a class="k-button" href="https://kaeso.example.com/orgs/org_1" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#0a0a0a;color:#ffffff;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;mso-hide:all;">Open updates</a><!--<![endif]--></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:16px 0 0 0;"><a class="k-text" href="https://github.com/logicplanes/kaeso/releases/tag/v1.4.0" target="_blank" style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;font-weight:500;color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;">Read the release notes</a></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:48px 0 0 0;"><table class="k-rule" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:24px 0 0 0;"><p class="k-tertiary" style="margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Sent by Kaeso at <a href="https://kaeso.example.com/" style="color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:none;">kaeso.example.com</a>.</p><p class="k-tertiary" style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#6b6b6b;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">You get this email because you hold the right “Manage updates”. <a href="https://kaeso.example.com/settings/account/notifications" style="color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;">Choose your emails</a> · <a href="https://kaeso.example.com/unsubscribe#token=usr_1.org_members.tag" style="color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></table></div></body></html>
